      "text": "DemosAU (MRP) (fieldwork 4 Aug–19 Sep, n=9,740) added — the two-party preferred estimate held at 52.4 (Labor v One Nation, implied flows). House effect (Labor v One Nation, implied flows; positive leans Labor): DemosAU (MRP) −0.4.",
